
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class):
@Mock creates a mock implementation for the classes you need.
@InjectMock creates an instance of the class and injects the mocks
that are marked with the annotations @Mock into it.
@spy()->used to partially mock the the methods and fields
@BeforeEach()->@BeforeEach annotation is used to signal that the annotated
method should be executed before each invocation of @Test,
must not static else throws exception
@RepeatedTest, @ParameterizedTest, or @TestFactory method in the current class.

